"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"INFEASIBLE: With the maximum channel length of 2\u202f\u00b5m the intrinsic gain of the NMOS (gm/gds \u2248 580) and PMOS (gm/gds \u2248 1258) devices limits the OTA closed\u2011loop gain to about 55\u202fdB (\u2248580). The required 65\u202fdB (\u22481778) cannot be reached regardless of bias current or gm/Id choices. Therefore the specification set cannot be satisfied with this 5\u2011transistor OTA topology in the GF180MCU 180\u202fnm process.\",\n  \"gmid1\": 4,\n  \"L1_um\": 2,\n  \"gmid3\": 10,\n  \"L3_um\": 2,\n  \"gmid5\": 4,\n  \"L5_um\": 2,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 80\n}"